        "cooked": "<p>Good-day</p>\n<p>I found a downloadable pdf of the <em>Fate of the Elder Gods</em> main rulebook, and decided to share this eldritch tome with you, my fellow cult leaders. Here it is:</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox googledrive\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1cIYuvaY7Fmrsy81uss0aD6OYd3Mfj0h3/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">drive.google.com</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    \n<div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/362;\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3106a144615714ec37f219e104c7305a16c80705_2_690x362.png\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"690\" height=\"362\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3106a144615714ec37f219e104c7305a16c80705_2_690x362.png, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3106a144615714ec37f219e104c7305a16c80705_2_1035x543.png 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/3106a144615714ec37f219e104c7305a16c80705.png 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3106a144615714ec37f219e104c7305a16c80705_2_10x10.png\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1cIYuvaY7Fmrsy81uss0aD6OYd3Mfj0h3/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">FotEG Main Rulebook.pdf</a></h3>\n\n<p>Google Drive file.</p>\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>I do hope you’ll find it useful.</p>",
